t-size: 11px !important; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: #008dc8; font-weight:700;\"\r\n>\r\nA MESSAGE FROM PEPSICO\r\n</p></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 3.5%; line-height: 1.5;\"><span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size: 26px; color: #222222;  font-family: 'gorditamedium', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;  letter-spacing: -0.1px; line-height: 1.5;\">Human-first AI starts in the field</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>\r\n<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47316523.435378/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL3Nwb25zb3JlZC9wdXR0aW5nLWZhcm1lcnMtZmlyc3Qtd2l0aC1haT9heGlvc19hZGxpbms9MSZ1dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBc85ea705\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://tpc.googlesyndication.com/pageadimg/imgad?id=CICAgJCVuLfF8QEQARgBKAEyCEJ3KbddPB1z\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" /></a>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"15\" style=\"height: 15px; font-size: 0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td class=\"v\" style=\"padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.75;  font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p>PepsiCo says AI adoption gets easier when tools work for farmers’ crops, land, climates and decision windows.</p>\r\n<p><strong>The strategy:</strong> Pair technology with trusted agronomists, local context and clear economic value.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47316523.435378/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL3Nwb25zb3JlZC9wdXR0aW5nLWZhcm1lcnMtZmlyc3Qtd2l0aC1haT9heGlvc19hZGxpbms9MSZ1dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCc85ea705\" target=\"_blank\">Read the Q&amp;A.</a></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n